 "GoXLR Utility kører stadig og styrer GoXLR’en. Tryk nedenfor for at lade GoXLR Studio overtage.": "GoXLR Utility is still running and controlling the GoXLR. Press below to let GoXLR Studio take over.",
 "GoXLR Utility styrer stadig GoXLR’en. Lad GoXLR Studio overtage – GoXLR Utility stoppes, og dens genvej i din Startup-mappe flyttes til backup. Andre autostarts står nedenfor.": "GoXLR Utility is still controlling the GoXLR. Let GoXLR Studio take over – GoXLR Utility is stopped, and its shortcut in your Startup folder is moved to backup. Other autostarts are listed below.",
