 "GoXLR-motoren kører inde i GoXLR Studio – der er intet separat program (bygget på GoXLR Utility {0}, MIT-licens).": "The GoXLR engine runs inside GoXLR Studio – there is no separate program (built on GoXLR Utility {0}, MIT license).",
