 "GoXLR-profilen skiftede til \"{0}\" (\"EQ følger GoXLR-profil\")": "The GoXLR profile changed to \"{0}\" (\"EQ follows GoXLR profile\")",
 "GoXLR-profiler": "GoXLR profiles",
 "GoXLR-profiler indeholder routing, faders, farver, effekter og sampler. Mikrofonprofiler (gain, EQ, gate, kompressor) ligger under Mikrofon. Scener i GoXLR Studio er hurtigere og kan også skifte Windows-enheder og afspilnings-EQ.": "GoXLR profiles contain routing, faders, colors, effects and sampler. Mic profiles (gain, EQ, gate, compressor) are under Mic. Scenes in GoXLR Studio are faster and can also switch Windows devices and playback EQ.",
 "GoXLR’en er ikke forbundet": "The GoXLR isn’t connected",
 "GoXLR’en er ikke forbundet – åbn filen igen, når den er, for at få profilerne med.": "The GoXLR isn’t connected – open the file again when it is, to get the profiles too.",
 "GoXLR’en er ikke forbundet, så dens profiler er ikke med.": "The GoXLR isn’t connected, so its profiles aren’t included.",
 "GoXLR’en gør det selv – også selvom GoXLR Studio ikke når at reagere. Fx en mørk profil ved dvale, så lyset slukker, og din normale profil igen ved opvågning.": "The GoXLR does it itself – even if GoXLR Studio doesn't get to react. E.g. a dark profile on sleep so the lights go off, and your normal profile again on wake.",
 "GoXLR’ens fader styrer lydstyrken. Med 100 % her kommer hele signalet igennem, og faderen får hele sit spænd.": "The GoXLR’s fader controls the volume. At 100% here the full signal gets through, and the fader gets its full range.",
 "GoXLR’ens samples-mappe er ikke kendt endnu – er GoXLR’en forbundet?": "The GoXLR's samples folder isn't known yet – is the GoXLR connected?",
 "Gode første funktioner: push-to-talk eller hold for at mute (host), mute af Discord, en lyd fra lydbanken, næste OBS-scene og \"Stream-sikker musik\".": "Good first functions: push-to-talk or hold to mute (cough), mute Discord, a sound from the soundboard, the next OBS scene and \"Stream-safe music\".",
